],[34022,17.6,1988,54,90,23],[34023,17.7,1988,57,89,24],[34024,17.8,1952,57,90,25]],"links":[["Benson County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/north-dakota/benson-county"],["ARC or PLC in Benson County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/benson-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years back to 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 41 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair ran 166% of normal on the middle of the grids, while February to March sat at 26%. So far in 2026, March to April and April to May both came in at 44% on the middle of the grids. Grid 33422 had its driest year in 1988 at 45%.</p>"}
